The café has not opened yet.
Jessy takes me to the espresso machine.
It is very big and shiny.
"This is our espresso machine," Jessy says.
First, she shows me the dials on it.
Then she shows me the steam wand.
"This steam wand is for the milk," she explains.
I watch her carefully.
She turns the dials slowly.
Then the machine makes a loud sound.
"Learning to use this takes a little time," Jessy says.
"Good patience and practice are needed."
I have not used an espresso machine before.
But I really want to learn to make coffee.
"I am ready to learn," I tell her.
Jessy nods.
I am waiting to make my first coffee.
